sections.content:
* Build Ledger's signup/login/refresh endpoints (bcrypt + jose JWTs + httpOnly cookies) — written from memory first, checking Days 111-116 only when genuinely stuck
* Build requireAuth middleware that attaches req.user with { userId, organizationId, role }
* Write Supertest coverage proving: unauthenticated requests are rejected, tampered tokens are rejected, and a reused refresh token is rejected after rotation
